+{"baseRefName":"main","body":"## Summary\n- reset the labyrinth grenade tutorial back to the first step when grenade preparation is canceled before the throw\n- allow the tutorial strikethrough animation to move backward so the crossed-out segment clears correctly\n- add a focused GUT regression test covering the canceled grenade-prep flow\n\n## Reproduction\n1. Start the labyrinth level tutorial.\n2. Hold the first grenade combo step (`G+ПКМ вправо`) until the first segment is crossed out.\n3. Release the input early instead of finishing the throw.\n4. Before this fix, the tutorial stayed partially completed instead of returning to the initial state.\n\n## Verification\n- Added `tests/unit/test_labyrinth_grenade_tutorial.gd` to reproduce the canceled-prep case.\n- Local automated execution could not be completed in this environment because `godot` is not installed (`/bin/bash: line 1: godot: command not found`).\n\nFixes #1817\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOQ35BQ879p1UV","author":{"login":"konard"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"## 🤖 Solution Draft Log\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\n\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\n- Model: gpt-5.4\n- Provider: OpenAI\n- Public pricing estimate: unknown\n- Token usage: 69,419 input, 5,689 output, 606,080 cache read, 0 cache write\n\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\n\nTotal: (69.4K + 606.1K cached) input tokens, 5.7K output tokens\n\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\n- Requested: `gpt-5.4`\n- **Model: GPT-5.4** (`gpt-5.4`)\n\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (9905KB)\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/ef0dd8bfcb2f99e3eee5fcd8e76c2175/raw/e47c99214573f8a8392eaffb4e03965f388383bf/solution-draft-log-pr-1776288367491.txt)\n\n---\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*","createdAt":"2026-04-15T21:26:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"min